# Trusted vivarium worker image digest (ghcr.io/<owner>/vivarium-worker@<digest>).
#
# This is the single source of truth for the image live-regression.yml cosign-verifies and
# pulls on its default ("test what you ship") path. It is auto-bumped by a REVIEWED pull
# request opened by worker-image.yml on each release tag (the human merges to advance trust).
# Do not hand-edit casually: changing this changes what CI trusts (a supply-chain decision).
#
# Format: a single `sha256:<64 hex>` token (comments/blank lines ignored).
